From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: macbox <macbox@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 01:11:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/25] trap-coherent surfaces, hooks and tests

rvg_coherent_* joins QEMU's page states to metal2vulkan's shadow_coherent, the
unmap of a surface with work running is Busy, and the display samples the
surface's own image. coherent_test.c runs the pages on a real KVM guest; the
census report prints the per-present cost against eager copies.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
